{"id":"4aa8d05c5e286fa1","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-seven-tuple-ntm.md","title":"73-df-seven-tuple-ntm — seven tuple ntm","display":"73-df-seven-tuple-ntm — seven tuple ntm","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-seven-tuple-ntm","display":"73-df-seven-tuple-ntm — seven tuple ntm","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-df-seven-tuple-ntm","73-definition-7.7"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-seven-tuple-ntm"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-seven-tuple-ntm — seven tuple ntm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" href=\"?note=2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" title=\"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-seven-tuple-ntm</span><span>73-definition-7.7</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup\">\\(\\sqcup\\)</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\)</span> 为候选七元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 的值是有限个三元组组成的集合，不是单值转移。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma},\\operatorname{Run}_N\">\\(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma},\\operatorname{Run}_N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" href=\"?note=2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" title=\"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics</a>；下式以单带实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=1\">\\(k=1\\)</span> 嵌入该模型。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w)\">\\(\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w)\\)</span> 是有限接受运行的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Accept}\">\\(\\mathrm{Accept}\\)</span> 保留原谓词名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\">\\(Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_M\">\\(\\Delta_M\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}\">\\(\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}\\)</span> 的定义中始终指给定七元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的相应投影；在集合定义的存在量词内，取被量化七元组的投影。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_M\">\\(\\Delta_M\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}\">\\(\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}\\)</span> 的子句中，候选七元组的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 具有类定义内所列的有限值函数类型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span> 的类定义不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AccPath}\">\\(\\mathrm{AccPath}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Accept}\">\\(\\mathrm{Accept}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的子句中则固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定空白字符满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>；此条件是旧元组接口的环境前提，不是对机器转移的额外限制。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\Delta_M\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left((q,\\langle a\\rangle),\n\\{(p,\\langle b\\rangle,\\langle D\\rangle):(p,b,D)\\in\\delta(q,a)\\}\\right):\nq\\in Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land a\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\Delta_M\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left((q,\\langle a\\rangle),\n\\{(p,\\langle b\\rangle,\\langle D\\rangle):(p,b,D)\\in\\delta(q,a)\\}\\right):\nq\\in Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land a\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)\\coloneqq\n(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,1,\\Delta_M,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)\\coloneqq\n(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,1,\\Delta_M,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NTM}\\coloneqq\n\\{M:\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\;M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\})\n\\land\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NTM}\\coloneqq\n\\{M:\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\;M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\})\n\\land\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\Bigl\\{\\rho\\in(\\operatorname{NConf}_{\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)})^{\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}}:\n\\operatorname{Run}_{\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)}(w,m,\\rho)\n\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\Bigl\\{\\rho\\in(\\operatorname{NConf}_{\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)})^{\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}}:\n\\operatorname{Run}_{\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)}(w,m,\\rho)\n\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\pi\\in\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w),\\qquad\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\pi\\in\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w),\\qquad\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma},\\operatorname{Run}_N$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]]；下式以单带实例 $k=1$ 嵌入该模型。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqcup","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma},\\operatorname{Run}_N","display":false},{"tex":"k=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Accept}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AccPath}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Accept}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\Delta_M\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left((q,\\langle a\\rangle),\n\\{(p,\\langle b\\rangle,\\langle D\\rangle):(p,b,D)\\in\\delta(q,a)\\}\\right):\nq\\in Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land a\\in\\Gamma\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)\\coloneqq\n(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,1,\\Delta_M,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NTM}\\coloneqq\n\\{M:\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\;M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\land\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\})\n\\land\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\Bigl\\{\\rho\\in(\\operatorname{NConf}_{\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)})^{\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}}:\n\\operatorname{Run}_{\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm N}(M)}(w,m,\\rho)\n\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(m))=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.7}\\vdash\nM\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\pi\\in\\mathrm{AccPath}(M,w),\\qquad\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\,w\\}","display":true}],"bytes":3071,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff77be8f80ee06ea","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"机器类及其语言见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-ntm]]；$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]]。"}],"outgoing":["2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","0a6da8c909717780"]}